  "lead": "一顆幾千年才回來一次的彗星，在黎明前掛了一個月。鎮上決定替下一次看見它的人，留下一箱故事。",
  "lead_en": "A comet that returns once in thousands of years hung in the dawn for a month. The town decided to leave a box of stories for whoever sees it next.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "一顆幾千年才回來一次的彗星，在黎明前掛了一個月。鎮上決定替下一次看見它的人，留下一箱故事。\n\n她沒有把箱子封起來。\n她把它交給了下一個人。",
  "statement_en": "A comet that returns once in thousands of years hung in the dawn for a month. The town decided to leave a box of stories for whoever sees it next.\n\nShe did not seal the box.\nShe handed it to the next person.",
  "afterword": "她沒有把箱子封起來。\n她把它交給了下一個人。",
  "afterword_en": "She did not seal the box.\nShe handed it to the next person.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
